<title>USA: Bear Stearns names new equity markets chief.</title>
<headline>Bear Stearns names new equity markets chief.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns &amp; Co Inc Friday said Victor Cohn has joined as a senior managing director and head of Equity Capital Markets.</p>
<p>Cohn was a manager and co-head of investment banking at UBS Securities, where he was also head of the capital markets division.</p>
